{
  "name": "amundsen",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 116.507,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Franklin's 129 men never came back.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.396,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "fe9ba9b990d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Amundsen had seven men and a herring boat.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.646,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "fe9ba9b990d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Why did it take him three years?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.767,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "fe9ba9b990d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "The answer is on this route, and in one harbour where he chose to stay for two winters.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.389,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "fe9ba9b990d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Roald Amundsen first read about Franklin as a boy of eight or nine.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.198,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "370cd6fbcd1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "On a rainy night in June 1903, Gjøa slipped out of Oslo, away from his creditors.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.95,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "370cd6fbcd1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "She was an old herring boat, carrying food for five years.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.609,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "370cd6fbcd1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "In August they anchored at Beechey Island, where Franklin had spent his last safe winter.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.772,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "370cd6fbcd1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Then they sailed south, down the same strait as Franklin.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.598,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "1dde380585c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "At King William Island, Franklin had taken the west side.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.428,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "1dde380585c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Amundsen took the east.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.698,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "1dde380585c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "When the weather turned, he steered into a small harbour, and by October the ice had locked them in.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.369,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "1dde380585c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "He stayed almost two years.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.994,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "117859f1fd3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Part of the reason was science: his men sledged out to locate the north magnetic pole.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.897,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "117859f1fd3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "And next door lived the Netsilik Inuit.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.593,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "117859f1fd3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "They taught the newcomers to dress in animal skins, because wet wool stops keeping you warm.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.066,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "117859f1fd3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "They showed them how to build snow houses, and how to travel with dogs.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.553,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "117859f1fd3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "Franklin's naval crews had not been trained for this.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.96,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "117859f1fd3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "In August 1905, Gjøa left the harbour and sailed west.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.146,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "851af974bad3"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Two weeks later, his first officer came running into the cabin.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.871,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "851af974bad3"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.5,
      "text": "\"Vessel in sight, sir!\"",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.501,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "851af974bad3"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It was an American whaler from San Francisco.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.598,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "851af974bad3"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "They had made it through.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.023,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "851af974bad3"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "Amundsen wrote that he could feel tears coming to his eyes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.632,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "851af974bad3"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "But the ice closed once more, off the coast of the Yukon.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.838,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f129882a814b"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So he skied about 800 kilometres to Eagle, Alaska, to send a telegram.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.029,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f129882a814b"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "He reached Nome in August 1906, three years after Oslo.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.96,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f129882a814b"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Five years later, he reached the South Pole first, in clothing modelled on the Netsilik's.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.89,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3b1dcca9f6fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "It took three years, and he spent nearly two of them learning.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.146,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3b1dcca9f6fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The Inuit had lived there all along.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.253,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3b1dcca9f6fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "This time, the visitors learned from them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/amundsen/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.737,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3b1dcca9f6fb"
    }
  ]
}
